      "updated": 1773319489683,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Extract images from the video.\n2. Extract and review information relative\nto the camera used to record.\n3. Prepare the main files or type of images\nto analyze them.\n4. Research some applications in the same\nfield for the other articles.\n5. Review them before applying or make any \nsuggestion.\n6. Identify the main camera or environments\nof our videos. (Point of View \nand Fixed Camera Vido)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Extract images from the video.\n2. Extract and review information relative\nto the camera used to record.\n3. Prepare the main files or type of images\nto analyze them.\n4. Research some applications in the same\nfield for the other articles.\n5. Review them before applying or make any \nsuggestion.\n6. Identify the main camera or environments\nof our videos. (Point of View \nand Fixed Camera Vido)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
